        <item>
            <title>3.22.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:55:02 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>224</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.22.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.22.2</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>The checkout now shows the full order summary, a field for discount codes and tax details.</li><li>MP4 recording dates follow the camera's time zone, and more videos now get a recording date.</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Your settings and folder setups are kept if Zush can't read them at launch, instead of being reset.</li><li>Settings no longer freeze while checking the Start at Login option.</li><li>Monitor no longer misses a file added right after resuming, and a watched folder that comes back is watched again.</li><li>Files added while names are being regenerated are analyzed right away.</li><li>Rename works again after a failed move into folders.</li><li>Cancelling an Ollama model download no longer selects the unfinished model.</li></ul>
]]></description>
